+  (4) wedge (PTV_SLOW_DEC_US window): R bounded and near 0 post recovery —
+      hs-injected pads are matched by the measured video ratchet;
+  (5) fx-wcl350 full-file BYTE gate pre8-vs-pre9 IDENTICAL (passive proof)
