+                                            * applied_offset, i.e. shifts the hs/sk reading by −applied_offset vs
+                                            * the raw source labels — a jump-to-live erase (applied_offset<0)
+                                            * parks the stall's dup-ratcheted skew in hs permanently. hs growing
